### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Elon Musk", "password": "syntaxerror" }

### Missing password -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "No Password" }

### Login (correct password) -> Success
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Elon Musk", "password": "syntaxerror" }

### Login (wrong password) -> Not Allowed
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Elon Musk", "password": "wrong" }

### Login (unknown user) -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nobody", "password": "x" }
